  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "This Privacy Policy explains how Aerogreen collects, uses, and protects information when you use our mobile and web application.",
  "privacyPolicyDataTitle": "Data we collect",
  "privacyPolicyDataBody": "We collect the account information you provide, including your name and email address. When you use Google Sign-In, we receive your Google account identity and verified email address. We also collect garden, device, sensor, schedule, and alert data needed to provide Aerogreen features. We process email-verification requests and support messages you send us.",
  "privacyPolicyUseTitle": "How we use data",
  "privacyPolicyUseBody": "We use your data to create and secure your account, connect and operate your devices, display garden information, send requested verification codes, provide support, and improve application reliability.",
  "privacyPolicySharingTitle": "How we share data",
  "privacyPolicySharingBody": "We do not sell your personal data. Google processes sign-in information when you choose Google Sign-In. Our email delivery provider processes your email address only to send verification codes. We may disclose information when required by law or to protect Aerogreen, users, and the public.",
  "privacyPolicySecurityTitle": "Security",
  "privacyPolicySecurityBody": "We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards, including encrypted connections and access controls. No internet service can guarantee absolute security.",
  "privacyPolicyRetentionTitle": "Data retention",
  "privacyPolicyRetentionBody": "We retain account and application data while your account remains active and as needed for security, legal obligations, dispute resolution, and service operations. We delete or anonymize data when it is no longer needed.",
  "privacyPolicyRightsTitle": "Your choices and rights",
  "privacyPolicyRightsBody": "You may request access, correction, export, or deletion of your personal data, subject to applicable law. Deleting your account may remove access to connected devices and historical garden information.",
  "privacyPolicyContactTitle": "Contact us",
  "privacyPolicyContactBody": "For privacy questions or data requests, email xteam.aerogreen@gmail.com.",
